8
00:00:21.425 --> 00:00:24.086
Its analysis points to merchant acceptance.

9
00:00:25.386 --> 00:00:26.896
Open the source.

10
00:00:26.906 --> 00:00:29.456
Check the publication and retrieval dates.

11
00:00:29.466 --> 00:00:32.006
Here, the publication date is inferred.

12
00:00:32.936 --> 00:00:36.366
keep other explanations open while their sources still need

13
00:00:36.376 --> 00:00:36.976
checking.

14
00:00:37.775 --> 00:00:39.605
Save the investigation.

15
00:00:39.615 --> 00:00:42.516
Return to the same passage, dates, and source links.

16
